  "body": "This is the ultimate Ready-to-go, development opportunity. We are offering the freehold sections with builder terms on Goldwater Drive options to buy one or two or three lots as a single acquisition.\r\n\r\nWith Resource Consent already approved (22 Aug 2025) for a seamless terrace row, you can skip the years of planning and move straight into the construction phase.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Price: from late $300k + GST per lot or bulk deal.\r\n• Each house is free-standalone.\r\n• Flexible Builder Terms: Secure the block now and manage your cash flow with terms starting only upon Building Consent (BC) issuance.\r\n• Lock in now for a project completing in the 2026 market.\r\n• Only 2 + 3 side-by-side lots ranging from 137m² to 190m².\r\n• Floor Plan: Each unit is RC-approved for a high-spec approx 152m² floor areas over two levels.\r\n• Smart 4-Bed with internal single garage layout: Includes a highly sought-after ground-floor internal garage combined with laundry, plus an open-plan kitchen combined with dining and living area flowing to outdoor decking, and one toilet.\r\n• Potential one exclusive car park for large vehicle at the rear of the house.\r\n• Level 1: four bedrooms (including Master) and a second full bathroom.\r\n• Specified in mixed Brick and weatherboard for a premium, durable finish.\r\n• Walking distance to the Hibiscus Coast Park & Ride (Express bus to Auckland CBD).\r\n• Directly adjacent to Pak’nSave Silverdale and the Silverdale Retail Centre.\r\n• Silverdale is one of Auckland’s fastest-growing suburbs with a severe shortage of modern, 4-bedroom 'lock-up and leave' homes in affordable price range.\r\n• Significant savings on site mobilization, scaffolding, and sub-contractor bulk rates.\r\n• The vendor provides the Building Consent at the purchaser's cost—move as fast as you want once the BC arrives.\r\n\r\nStop searching for individual lots. Build the row. Secure the profit.\r\nContact us today for the full RC package, architectural drawings, and terms of sale.",
